Content-Type:   text/plain; charset=US-ASCII
X-Originating-IP: [10.175.127.227]
X-ClientProxiedBy: dggems704-chm.china.huawei.com (10.3.19.181) To
 dggema762-chm.china.huawei.com (10.1.198.204)
